Production Issue: Database Timeouts (But DB Was Fine)

1. Pods were healthy.
2. Database CPU was 30%.
3. Still users were getting ⏳ timeouts.

Root cause?

👉 Connection Pool Exhaustion

App allowed only 20 DB connections.
Traffic spike → 50 concurrent requests.

*20 processed.
*30 waited.
*Timeout. 💥

Database wasn’t overloaded.
Application concurrency was.

🎯 Lesson:

CPU doesn’t tell the full story. Concurrency limits break systems silently.
